@startuml

actor "后台管理用户" as User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend Controller" as BackendController
participant "Backend Service" as BackendService
participant "Database" as Database

User -> Frontend: 触发保存操作
Frontend -> Frontend: 构造保存数据
Frontend -> BackendController: 发起新增/更新寄养信息请求
BackendController -> BackendService: 调用updateById方法
BackendService -> Database: 更新寄养信息
Database --> BackendService: 返回更新结果
BackendService -> Database: 查询对应房间信息
Database --> BackendService: 返回房间信息
alt 寄养状态为领养中
    BackendService -> Database: 更新房间状态为占用
    BackendService -> Database: 更新房间对应的宠物信息
else 寄养状态为已领养
    BackendService -> Database: 更新房间状态为空闲
    BackendService -> Database: 更新房间对应的宠物信息为空
end
Database --> BackendService: 返回更新结果
BackendService --> BackendController: 返回更新结果
BackendController --> Frontend: 返回更新结果

@enduml
